{"id":"8d1bb4a0b891b7d4","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-impdist.md","title":"Distance between term cubes","display":"df-impdist — Distance between term cubes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-impdist","aliases":["27-df-impdist"],"display":"df-impdist — Distance between term cubes","depends_on":["[[27-df-subcube]]"],"local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-impdist"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-impdist</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-impdist — Distance between term cubes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c6221762bee7e40\" href=\"?note=6c6221762bee7e40\" title=\"27-df-subcube\">27-df-subcube</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，固定本文件各函数、项及关系的元数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cube}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cube}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c6221762bee7e40\" href=\"?note=6c6221762bee7e40\" title=\"27-df-subcube\">27-df-subcube</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{dist}:\\mathrm{Term}_n^{2}\\to\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{dist}:\\mathrm{Term}_n^{2}\\to\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{dist}(T,U)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|\\{i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\mid x_i\\neq y_i\\}|\\mid x\\in\\mathrm{Cube}(T)\\land y\\in\\mathrm{Cube}(U)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{dist}(T,U)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|\\{i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\mid x_i\\neq y_i\\}|\\mid x\\in\\mathrm{Cube}(T)\\land y\\in\\mathrm{Cube}(U)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The minimum exists because canonical term cubes are finite and nonempty.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-subcube","status":"resolved","id":"6c6221762bee7e40","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-subcube]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-subcube","status":"resolved","id":"6c6221762bee7e40","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n$ and $\\mathrm{Cube}$ (see [[27-df-subcube]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cube}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{dist}:\\mathrm{Term}_n^{2}\\to\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{dist}(T,U)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|\\{i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\mid x_i\\neq y_i\\}|\\mid x\\in\\mathrm{Cube}(T)\\land y\\in\\mathrm{Cube}(U)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":817,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-impdist|df-impdist — Distance between term cubes]]"}],"outgoing":["6c6221762bee7e40"]}